- Yeah, yeah.

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:27.150
- I mean, not everyone, maybe
some people are fortunate

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:28.680
that they don't have that,
but even this week, you know.

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:29.550
I get them,

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:30.690
you know, sometimes.
- Yeah.

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.460
- Regularly, but I think any time

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:35.400
that you are about any sort
of empowerment or freedom

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:38.430
or, you know, self-acceptance,

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:42.210
