00:02:57.278 --> 00:02:58.111
to be that vulnerable, yeah.
- It's hard to do,

00:02:58.111 --> 00:02:59.370
and I'm also a big guarded, you know?

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:01.410
I come across pretty open,

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:03.690
but I do keep a lotta
things close to my chest.

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:08.040
