00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:38.820
so that we understand that
when there's heartbreak

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:40.110
and when there's loss

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:41.130
and when you're having a moment

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:42.520
where you feel totally empowered and-

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:43.830
- Yeah.
- You have tools

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:45.090
to be able to navigate that.

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:46.230
When you're feeling creative,

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:48.330
when new changes are happening,

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:50.310
when you wanna reflect,
when you wanna reorganize.

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:52.590
Like all of these moments
that happen in our life,

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:54.990
they happen sometimes when
we're not expecting them.

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:58.440
