00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.880
And it can be legacy for
people that are still alive.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:20.070
It can be your children

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:23.013
or your friends or it can
be people that you've lost,

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:25.800
people that have passed on.

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:29.310
And you can use whatever you've learned

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:31.770
as a way to continue-
- Keep them alive.

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:32.940
- To keep them alive.
